<gpx version="1.1" creator="Taiwan Dirt Atlas" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>和平林道</name><desc>Forest road. The best CRF day in the north-east. Starts at the south end of 蘇花. Motorcycles pass the 4.5K checkpoint freely; cars are stopped at 18K. Mostly gravel, mine trucks. Check the road is open to vehicles before riding it. 騎之前先確認可以通行。</desc></metadata><wpt lat="24.30994" lon="121.74643"><name>和平林道 start</name></wpt><trk><name>和平林道</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="24.3205" lon="121.7206"/><trkpt lat="24.3197" lon="121.7205"/><trkpt lat="24.319" lon="121.7194"/><trkpt lat="24.3193" lon="121.7184"/><trkpt lat="24.3191" lon="121.719"/><trkpt lat="24.3187" lon="121.7194"/><trkpt lat="24.3189" lon="121.7197"/><trkpt lat="24.3187" lon="121.7203"/><trkpt lat="24.3188" lon="121.7209"/><trkpt lat="24.3193" lon="121.7211"/><trkpt lat="24.3198" lon="121.7222"/><trkpt lat="24.319" lon="121.7213"/><trkpt lat="24.3182" lon="121.7211"/><trkpt lat="24.3179" lon="121.7205"/><trkpt lat="24.3178" lon="121.7198"/><trkpt lat="24.3177" lon="121.7198"/><trkpt lat="24.3177" lon="121.7206"/><trkpt lat="24.3179" lon="121.7211"/><trkpt lat="24.3186" lon="121.7218"/><trkpt lat="24.3187" lon="121.7226"/><trkpt lat="24.3185" lon="121.7219"/><trkpt lat="24.3171" lon="121.7213"/><trkpt lat="24.3169" lon="121.7201"/><trkpt lat="24.3167" lon="121.7198"/><trkpt lat="24.3167" lon="121.7215"/><trkpt lat="24.3174" lon="121.7219"/><trkpt lat="24.3178" lon="121.7226"/><trkpt lat="24.3172" lon="121.7235"/><trkpt lat="24.3176" lon="121.7237"/><trkpt lat="24.3181" lon="121.7261"/><trkpt lat="24.3186" lon="121.7271"/><trkpt lat="24.3167" lon="121.7286"/><trkpt lat="24.3162" lon="121.73"/><trkpt lat="24.3155" lon="121.7305"/><trkpt lat="24.316" lon="121.73"/><trkpt lat="24.3163" lon="121.7285"/><trkpt lat="24.3174" lon="121.7275"/><trkpt lat="24.3175" lon="121.7271"/><trkpt lat="24.3165" lon="121.7249"/><trkpt lat="24.316" lon="121.7249"/><trkpt lat="24.3141" lon="121.7255"/><trkpt lat="24.